[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0010","text":"朝日，拍摄辛苦了\n拍到了很多好照片哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0020","text":"真的吗！\n太好了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0030","text":"咦，这个是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0040","text":"这是其他成员的剧照啊\n要看看吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0050","text":"嘿……好厉害啊～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0060","text":"不过，还是在舞台上看到的更有意思呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0070","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0080","text":"演唱会的时候大家的衣服会飘啊飘～的\n还会闪闪发光～哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0090","text":"嗯，确实……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0100","text":"和大家一起站上舞台，真让人期待呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
